# 3D Retinal Digital Twin for AMD and DME

## 1. Project Overview

Humara project **3D Retinal Digital Twin for AMD and DME** hai. Iska main goal real retinal OCT (Optical Coherence Tomography) scans ka use karke retina ke andar disease-related regions ko visualize karna aur unka 3D representation banana hai.

AMD ka full form **Age-related Macular Degeneration** hai aur DME ka full form **Diabetic Macular Edema** hai.

OCT ek medical imaging technique hai jo retina ki cross-sectional images provide karti hai. Hum dataset ke OCT volumes aur unke corresponding segmentation masks ka use karke marked regions ko 2D aur 3D mein visualize kar rahe hain.

### Humara main objective

1. Publicly available OCT dataset access karna.
2. OCT volumes aur unke segmentation masks ko load karna.
3. OCT slices ko visualize karna.
4. Segmentation masks ko original OCT images par overlay karna.
5. Marked regions ka 3D point cloud banana.
6. Segmentation mask se 3D surface mesh generate karna.
7. AMD aur DME scans ko compare karne ka pipeline develop karna.
8. Future mein ek interactive dashboard banana jahan user scan select kar sake, slices explore kar sake aur 3D visualization dekh sake.

**Important:** Abhi humara project ek real-data-based visualization prototype hai. Yeh complete anatomical human-eye model nahi hai aur na hi automatic disease diagnosis system hai.

