## 2. Dataset Details

### Dataset name

Comprehensive 3D Optical Coherence Tomography Dataset for AMD and DME: Facilitating Deep-Learning-Based 3D Segmentation

### Dataset links

- Figshare dataset: https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.30582035
- Research paper: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-025-06497-1

### Dataset ke baare mein

Dataset archive ka naam `AMD_DME_3D_Dataset.7z` hai.

- Archive size approximately 19.65 GB hai.
- Humne archive ki file listing remotely access ki.
- Archive mein 305 entries mili hain.
- Entries mein AMD/DME ke OCT input files aur segmentation masks shamil hain.
- Exact independent patient count ko file count se assume nahi karna chahiye.

### Humne dataset ko remotely kaise access kiya?

Humne HTTP Range Requests use kiye. Is technique se server se file ke selected byte ranges request kiye ja sakte hain.

Isse humne:
- Archive ka initial header read kiya.
- Archive ka last 39-byte next-header region read kiya.
- `py7zr` ka use karke archive listing read ki.
- Ek remote seekable reader banaya jo `seek()` aur `read()` support karta hai.

**Limitation:** Remote access ka matlab zero data transfer nahi hai. Archive se selected files extract karte waqt compressed data ka additional portion download/process ho sakta hai. Agar archive solid-compressed hai, toh selected file extract karne ke liye pehle ka compressed data bhi process karna pad sakta hai.

